  "rule": "This list may only SHRINK. scripts/outward-claims-guard.mjs fails on any unfollowable entry NOT named here, so a new bad publish cannot hide inside an old allowance; it also fails when an entry here has closed and has not been removed, so a fix cannot go unrecorded. NAMES, not a count: on 2026-09-06 the count fell 37 -> 19 while all 19 were NEW, and a count baseline reported that as an improvement.",
  "why_a_file": "This was an environment variable, REGISTRY_BASELINE, defaulting to 0. A run without it failed with 'up from 0' on a healthy registry, and any run could pass REGISTRY_BASELINE=999 and go quiet. A baseline you can set from the command line is not a baseline. The estate's other two (scripts/link-gate-baseline.json, scripts/recomputability-baseline.json) are files; so is this one now.",
